{"nodes": [{"id": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "label": "v3 artefact subsystem design: the references-not-copies graph-RAG artefact built natively in v3 \u2014 spine, reference triple, resolution, pipeline, probe, mapping key, chunks/tags, routing, facets, build-time validation.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_references_not_copies", "label": "Core principle: the graph indexes references into untouched authoritative raw source plus a derived semantic layer; content is resolved on demand, never stored as a mutated second copy (v1's c.content prose was the inversion).", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_reference_triple", "label": "A reference is {file_id, scheme, address}; the scheme (json_pointer / char_span / row / reference-only) is chosen by data shape, and rendered prose is a transient tagger view, never stored.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_resolution_hash_verify", "label": "Resolution reads raw in place under data_root by relative path; identity is the content hash (file_id = sha256[:24]); the hash is verified on resolve and resolution fails loud on mismatch \u2014 no content-addressed store.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_derive_corpus_quarantine", "label": "Stage-0 derive-corpus structurally quarantines RAG-unsafe surfaces (HERB eval oracle + team/customers membership links) into a corpus view the probe cannot sense; contamination is impossible by construction, the eval reads the oracle in place from raw.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_pipeline_skeleton", "label": "Pipeline: derive-corpus \u2192 scan \u2192 probe \u2192 reference \u2192 structure \u2192 tag \u2192 retrieve (Match\u2192Filter\u2192Rank\u2192Cap), each arm reading references over the untouched corpus view.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_shape_probe", "label": "The shape probe climbs each parsed file and recovers the structural schema with zero meaning knowledge \u2014 one fused shape tree, repetition collapsed, per-field repetition ratio \u2014 describing shape + candidates only, leaving entity-vs-content to the mapping.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_graph_spine", "label": "The graph spine is closed canon: Source \u2192 File \u2192 Chunk \u2192 Tag are the only nodes; nothing else (records, branches, metadata directories) is materialized.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_node_attribute_rule", "label": "Node-vs-attribute rule: a thing is a node only when others resolve through its facts or retrieval walks through it; otherwise it is an indexed attribute you filter or boost by, riding at the structural scope where the value sits.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_per_chunk_tags", "label": "Each emitted tag is its own per-chunk :Tag node bound to one chunk (no shared vocabulary); same phrase elsewhere is text equality, making retag/delete local and lossless, with a shared view derivable by normalized text.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_mapping_key", "label": "The mapping key is a per-dataset declarative settings file read by one generic loader: shape\u2192handling is automatic (repetition ratio splits attribute vs raw), and only three meaning judgments \u2014 content choice, directories+kind, id-space assignment \u2014 are declared.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_coherent_episode_chunk", "label": "A chunk is a coherent episode (thread/conversation/document), not a fixed-size window; the ~3000-token cap is a guardrail set at the tagger's effective focus span, not an embedder limit.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_materialized_path", "label": "The chunk index is a materialized path of integer components \u2014 canonical source structure top to bottom, records included \u2014 with the subchunk split the only minted non-canonical tier (no parent node); the path does triple duty: ancestry, expansion, diversity.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_deterministic_seam_finder", "label": "One fully deterministic top-down seam-finder (no embeddings, no LLM) does episode segmentation and over-budget splitting, with per-content-kind seams dispatched by probe shape and a uniform walk-to-strongest-seam-and-recurse split rule, no minimum size.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_stateless_tagger", "label": "One stateless temp-0 structured-output call per chunk (phrases out, no description, no numbers, instance discarded), graph-assembled context handed in as explicit input \u2014 statelessness is the precondition for build-time validation.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_facet_set", "label": "Facets are parallel relevance channels / a tag's character (not buckets): topic, process, stance, communicative-function, temporal-stance(TAM), allocated facts\u2192structure and semantics\u2192facets across seven converging linguistic traditions; the model emits no numbers.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_routing_model", "label": "Retrieval is weighted activation propagation (no hard filters): a prompt-conditioned weighted dot product accumulates per-facet channels at chunks, hard fields enter as soft boosts, and a deterministic exact single-anchor jump narrows with a loud automatic widen.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_literal_matching_prepass", "label": "A deterministic pre-pass matches the prompt against actual hard-field values read at query time through field connections (no pre-embedded value vocabulary): exact literals give strong boosts, the toolless one-shot interpreter flags type/wanted-vs-excluded, a scoped string-distance lookup catches typos.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "v3_artefact_design_build_time_validation", "label": "Build-time validation catches tagger errors before a full run: the deterministic prefix runs free with golden tests, tags get code data-quality assertions (SPADE/promptfoo), error analysis on ~20-40 traces precedes the assertions, catching needs ~30 draws vs measuring 250-500.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "v3_artefact_design_references_not_copies", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_reference_triple", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_resolution_hash_verify", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_derive_corpus_quarantine", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_pipeline_skeleton", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_shape_probe", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_graph_spine", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_node_attribute_rule", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_per_chunk_tags", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_mapping_key", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_coherent_episode_chunk", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_materialized_path", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_deterministic_seam_finder", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "v3_artefact_design_stateless_tagger", "target": "v3_artefact_design_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "weight": 1.0}, {